  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_excu",
      "name": {
        "en": "Executor's Badge",
        "zh": "送葬人证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "uniequip_001_excu",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Executor has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for closing distance whilst conducting suppressive fire against multitudes of enemies.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Sniper Operator during field operations to exercise Spreadshooter responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员送葬人擅长近距离射击并对复数敌人进行火力压制\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为狙击干员，行使散射手职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_excu",
      "name": {
        "en": "Executor's Satchel",
        "zh": "执行者随身包",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_excu",
      "description": {
        "en": "'Seriously, is it really okay to be going through Federico's bag like this?'\n'It's just a routine check while he's away at the ceremony—we're making sure all his gear's in order.'\n'You were the one who wanted to know why his halo looked that way. Don't tell me you're no longer curious.'\n'Fine... I am, but this feels sketchy...'\n'Then why don't you go touch it yourself and come back and tell us what that thing on his halo is?!'\n'...Forget it. I could never do something like that, not with that poker face of his.'\n'Which is why I'm guessing it's some sort of emotional amplifier or something.'\n'Don't be ridiculous. You don't really believe people can hang things on their halo, do you?'\n'My neighbor's cousin's classmate, who works in a psych ward, said it's possible to attach things to a halo now. Some new tech.'\n'That sounds a bit dubious—I read a book on psychoanalysis the other day, and it said that your halo is shaped by your inner thoughts. If you ask me, Federico probably wants to empathize with others, but he's physically unable to, which is why his halo has a 'hearing-aid' on it.'\n'Well in that case, I think his hearing-aid needs a new battery...'\n'Oh, come on. He cares more about how many bullets are left in his gun than anyone else's feelings. I'd say that thing on his halo is an indicator showing how much ammo he has left.'\n'That <i>would</i> explain how he always knows...'\n'Nonsense. I've known—uh, been around—Federico since we were young. That thing was there even before he became an executor.'\n'Are you guys crazy? Have you ever seen anyone else hanging stuff on their halo?'\n'Alright, alright, if it's really some kind of external attachment, we'll know by looking through his bag. Captain Gianna, have you found anything?'\n'It's all pretty normal—magazines, water, and... an umbrella. So he didn't stash it in his bag?'\n'I told you it's not some weird peripheral device!'\n'He's so attached to it that he won't take it off, even when he's about to be made a Saint. Is he planning to show it to His Holiness the Pope?'\n'What is who planning to show me?'\n'Y-Your Holiness?! Has the ceremony ended? Why are you here?'\n'I should be the one asking you that question. Why are two executors and a captain of the Pontifica Cohors off duty, sneaking around here with a notary apprentice?'\n'We just wanted to know what that device on Federico's halo is for!'\n'Oh, that thing? Just think of it as a height marker.'\n'A... height marker? Your Holiness, how do you know that?'\n'Of course I know. I've been watching him for over ten years. The taller he grows, the more antennas he has. At first, he had only one, and now he has several. Ah—Federico has grown quite tall.'\n'Over ten years? Did the Law choose him to be a Saint that long ago?!'\n'Saint? Of course not. Back then, Federico was just Federico.'",
        "zh": "“说真的，像这样翻费德里科前辈的包真的好吗？”\n“我们是例行检查，趁着费德里科去参加仪式，帮他给随身装备查缺补漏罢了。”\n“是你先好奇他的光环为什么长那样的，别告诉我这时候你又突然不好奇了。”\n“好……好奇，我是很好奇啦，但是这样鬼鬼祟祟的感觉……”\n“那要不你自己去摸摸看，回来再告诉我们他光环上那东西究竟是不是外设好了。”\n“……算了，看着他那张冷冰冰的脸，我干不出来这种事。”\n“所以我才猜那是情感增幅元件之类的东西嘛。”\n“别傻了，你不会真的相信有人能往光环上挂东西吧？”\n“我邻居说，他的表亲在医院精神科工作的同学说，往光环上挂东西是有可能的，是什么最新技术来着。”\n“听起来就不靠谱——我前几天看了一本精神分析学的书，书里说你心里想着什么，律法就会让你的光环显现成什么样子。要我说，费德里科的潜意识里应该也很想和别人感同身受，但因为生理缺陷无法做到，所以光环上就有了这么一个助听器一样的结构。”\n“如果真是这样，那这个助听器也不是很有效啊……”\n“得了吧，比起别人的感情，费德里科更关心自己的铳里还有多少发子弹，他的光环是个弹药指示器，用来表示弹药余量的多寡。”\n“怪不得费德里科前辈总是能记得子弹数量呢……”\n“肯定不是，我从小就认识——呃，见过费德里科，那玩意在他当执行者之前就有了。”\n“你们怕不是疯了，你们有见过其他人往自己的光环上挂东西吗？”\n“好了好了，到底是不是外设，翻翻他的包不就知道了？吉安队长，你到底翻到了没有？”\n“包里都是很常规的东西啊，弹夹、水，还有伞……难道他没把那东西放在包里？”\n“我就说不是什么外设嘛！”\n“多宝贝的东西，要当圣徒了都舍不得摘，难道要拿去见教宗阁下不成——”\n“要拿什么来见我？”\n“教宗阁下？！仪式结束了吗？您怎么在这里？”\n“我倒是想问了，你们两个执行者一个戍卫队队长没在岗位上，带着公证所的见习生偷偷摸摸地在这里做什么呢？”\n“我们只是想知道，费德里科前辈光环上的装置到底是干什么用的！”\n“那个东西啊，把它当作身高标记就好。”\n“身、身高标记？教宗阁下，您是怎么知道的？”\n“我当然知道，这十多年来我都看着他呢，他长得越高，天线就越多嘛，最初只有一根，现在都有好几根天线了——瞧瞧，费德里科已经长这么高了。”\n“十多年？难道律法在那个时候就选定费德里科成为圣徒了？！”\n“什么圣徒不圣徒的，那个时候，就只有费德里科而已。”",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
